abstract: >-
  Metadata and archival-readiness follow-up to NAAIL OpenLab V2026.4-R1.
  This release freezes release-specific citation metadata, DOI-readiness
  documentation, and the distinction between portfolio-level public releases
  and validated executable checkpoints. It does not claim independent
  scientific validation of registered experiments or external integrations.
